### Configuration Variables
# Change @baseUrl to your live Cloudflare Worker URL when testing in production
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8787
# @baseUrl = https://expense-tracker.<your-subdomain>.workers.dev

# Replace with the value of INGESTION_TOKEN from your .dev.vars / Cloudflare Secrets
@token = your_ingestion_token_here


### 1. Health Check (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health


### 2. Capture Transaction (Ingest SMS)
POST {{baseUrl}}/capture
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "sender": "IDFCFB-S",
  "message": "Spent Rs.555.16 from A/C XX4870 at Zomato Online Order on 13/10/26. Not you? Call 180010888/SMS BLOCK (last 4 digit of card) to 5676732. IDFC FIRST Bank"
}


### 3. Reprocess Unparsed Transactions (1 to 5 IDs)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reprocess
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "ids": [
    "paste_id_1_here",
    "paste_id_2_here"
  ]
}

